# Qoin Economy Rules
## Fixed DenominationsQoins can only hold ONE of these rupee values:`[2000, 500, 200, 100, 50, 20, 10, 5, 2, 1]`
**No single Qoin can hold any other value** (e.g., no ₹7 Qoin, no ₹300 Qoin).
## Greedy Algorithm```pythondef min_qoins_for_amount(amount):    qoins = []    remaining = amount    for denom in [2000, 500, 200, 100, 50, 20, 10, 5, 2, 1]:        while remaining >= denom:            qoins.append(denom)            remaining -= denom    return qoins```
Weekly Settlement (NOT real‑time)
· Transactions recorded in pending_transactions during the week.· Sunday 23:59 – process_weekly_settlement() runs:  · Calculate net rupee amount owed to/from each user.  · Convert net amounts into Qoins (using greedy algorithm).  · Transfer Qoins from payer to payee.  · Generate weekly_statements for users with activity.
